' Duesenberg pulls away on the straights; the Alfa Romeos gain in the turns.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":4,"text":"Kreis brakes hard at the first Lesmo turn, spins onto the grass and is out; Campari leads again.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":7,"text":"Guyot retires; twelve cars remain.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":10,"text":"Milton closes to eight seconds behind DePaolo.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":13,"text":"Milton passes DePaolo just before the grandstand for third.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":13,"text":"Plat\u00e8 retires the Chiribiri with a broken clutch.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":14,"text":"Materassi has an accident and pits with a leaking fuel tank and supercharger trouble.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":15,"text":"After 15 laps Campari leads Brilli Peri by about 19 seconds, with Milton and DePaolo next.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":20,"text":"Costantini stops for the third time, changing plugs in two minutes; Goux leads the other Bugattis by more than a minute.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":21,"text":"Materassi stops again for plugs and oil.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":21,"text":"On lap 21 Costantini made the fastest lap of the small cars in 4m05.71s at an average speed of 146.508 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":25,"text":"After 25 laps, Campari led in 1h34m54s followed by Brilli Peri in 1h35m06s, Milton in 1h36m06s and DePaolo in 1h37m11s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":28,"text":"Materassi retires in the pits.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":28,"text":"DePaolo pits for two minutes: fuel, rear wheels, and Marinoni takes over.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":32,"text":"Brilli Peri is first of the leaders to pit: rear wheels, fuel and oil, three minutes. Milton moves to second.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":32,"text":"Santoleri skids off at the first Lesmo bend; the Chiribiri overturns three times but he escapes unhurt.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":33,"text":"Campari pits for 3m18s, fuel and rear wheels; Minozzi takes over. Milton leads.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":34,"text":"Minozzi, in Campari's car, stops for over three minutes with a loose carburettor compensation pipe.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":35,"text":"Milton leads after 35 laps from Marinoni (for DePaolo), Brilli Peri and Minozzi (for Campari).","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":36,"text":"Milton pits for fuel, oil, rear wheels and a drink: four and a half minutes. Brilli Peri leads.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":40,"text":"After 40 laps Brilli Peri was no longer challenged at 154.982 km/h average speed.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":41,"text":"Milton stops with a broken oil pipe; he loses 22 minutes and can then only use direct drive.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":42,"text":"P. de Vizcaya stops with gearbox trouble.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":43,"text":"On lap 43 Brilli Peri beat Campari's earlier lap time of 3m44.54s, reaching 3m37.49s at an average of 165.524 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":45,"text":"Brilli Peri leads Marinoni (for DePaolo) by nearly six minutes.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"Brilli Peri continued in the lead unchallenged lapping between 3m40s and 3m45s. In comparison, Milton lapped at around 3m55s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":53,"text":"The Bugattis make their fuel stops.","q":false},{"lap":57,"text":"Sozzi pits and Campari takes his car back.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":58,"text":"Marinoni pits: left tyre, fuel, oil; DePaolo takes over again.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":61,"text":"At the 61st lap Brilli Peri passed in front of the grandstand at a reduced speed with the right front tire flat.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":62,"text":"The Alfa Romeos, now confident of victory, slowed their pace considerably and Brilli Peri, who was still the fastest, made laps in 3m46s and 3m48s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":65,"text":"Brilli Peri leads DePaolo and Campari; Goux is fourth.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":67,"text":"Goux retires at the pits with a broken valve.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":74,"text":"DePaolo, second, makes a short pit stop.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":76,"text":"DePaolo stops again; the whole carburettor is changed and he falls to sixth.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":80,"text":"DePaolo passes F. de Vizcaya for fifth.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":80,"text":"Brilli Peri completed his last lap and crossed the finish line to much applause from the huge crowd, who waved their hats and clapped their hands.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":80,"text":"Campari is second, Costantini third, Milton fourth, DePaolo fifth.","q":false,"c":1}]}